# Requests for PayPilot.Api.
# When running through the Aspire AppHost, the Api uses the ports from launchSettings.json
# (http://localhost:5115, https://localhost:7155). If the dashboard shows a different URL, update it here.
@PayPilot.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5115

### Health check (from ServiceDefaults)
GET {{PayPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Chat: streamed answer (Server-Sent Events)
POST {{PayPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "What is the difference between gross and net pay?"
}

### Chat: a payroll question
POST {{PayPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "Explain in two sentences why net pay can differ from month to month."
}

### Chat: off-topic (see how the system prompt handles it)
POST {{PayPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "What is the capital of France?"
}

### Chat: invalid request (missing message) - expect 400
POST {{PayPilot.Api_HostAddress}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
